## Author Profile

### Dr. Ashish Indani

Dr. Ashish Indani is a physician, medical-device clinical and regulatory ex=
pert, researcher, author, and innovation leader with more than two decades =
of experience across the global life-sciences industry. His career brings t=
ogether clinical affairs, regulatory strategy, research and innovation, pat=
ient safety, and the responsible adoption of emerging healthcare technologi=
es. [diaglobal](https://www.diaglobal.org/zh-cn/conference-listing/meetings=
/2024/09/confluence-of-care-pharmacovigilance-clinical-innovation-regulator=
y-sciences-and-medical-devices-elevating-patient-safety/speakers)

He has held leadership and advisory responsibilities with prominent organis=
ations including Stryker, Tata Consultancy Services, Meril Life Sciences, B=
iosensors International, and Advanced MedTech Solutions. His professional p=
ortfolio spans clinical investigation planning and execution, clinical eval=
uation, post-market surveillance, materiovigilance, pharmacovigilance, medi=
cal writing, risk management, and regulatory engagement across major intern=
ational frameworks and standards, including US FDA requirements, EU MDR, IM=
DRF, ICH-GCP, ISO 13485, ISO 14971, and ISO 14155. [thinki](https://thinki.=
in/web/leadership-team/dr-ashish-indani)

Dr. Indani=92s academic foundation in medicine, clinical-trial management, =
and research methodology is complemented by a strong innovation portfolio. =
His interests and contributions extend to artificial intelligence, machine =
learning, data science, blockchain, biosensors, nanotechnology, and digital=
 health. He has been associated with the development and deployment of AI-e=
nabled pharmacovigilance solutions and has contributed to research and inno=
vation initiatives focused on improving healthcare safety, efficiency, and =
evidence generation. [diaglobal](https://www.diaglobal.org/zh-cn/conference=
-listing/meetings/2024/09/confluence-of-care-pharmacovigilance-clinical-inn=
ovation-regulatory-sciences-and-medical-devices-elevating-patient-safety/sp=
eakers)

As an author of *Essentials of Medical Device Clinical Research*, Dr. Indan=
i transforms complex clinical, scientific, and regulatory knowledge into a =
structured and practical resource for professionals, researchers, innovator=
s, and students. He is also a conference and TEDx speaker, using his platfo=
rm to advance dialogue on medical-device research, regulatory science, pati=
ent safety, and the future of healthcare innovation. [youtube](https://www.=
youtube.com/watch?v=3DZyhmdm7TSVg)

### Short Version

Dr. Ashish Indani is a physician, author, and global medical-device expert =
with more than two decades of experience in clinical affairs, regulatory st=
rategy, research, innovation, and patient safety. His expertise spans clini=
cal investigations, clinical evaluation, post-market surveillance, pharmaco=
vigilance, medical writing, risk management, and global regulatory framewor=
ks. With a portfolio encompassing AI, machine learning, biosensors, nanotec=
hnology, and digital health, he works at the intersection of evidence, regu=
lation, and healthcare innovation. He is the author of *Essentials of Medic=
al Device Clinical Research* and a recognised speaker on the future of medi=
cal-device clinical research. [diaglobal](https://www.diaglobal.org/zh-cn/c=
onference-listing/meetings/2024/09/confluence-of-care-pharmacovigilance-cli=
nical-innovation-regulatory-sciences-and-medical-devices-elevating-patient-=
safety/speakers)

### Suggested Tagline

**Bridging clinical evidence, regulatory science, and innovation to advance=
 safer medical technologies.**

